## 11. Release decision

**Implementation/local acceptance: PASS. Production readiness: NO-GO.** The latest source passes 102/102 regression tests and 9/9 fallback acceptance subcommands with three repeated five-image exact-match batches, both reverse orders, no-network checks, and integrated stall/recovery. RC2 is a clean, checksum-verified release candidate, not a production release. The archive digest and verification JSON are supplied separately. The remaining target Windows Node.js 24 clean-install/test run, Windows native Tesseract comparison, and authorized live Discord smoke tests are explicit blockers.

